{"research_date": "2026-09-10", "pairs": [{"pair_id": "conflict_cd0177d1250b0d1f718ce166", "claim_ids": ["claim_8361c7f7ee41012c3797def1", "claim_d8d09b08d816b3b378d7df3f"], "query_ids": ["q_164"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_8361c7f7ee41012c3797def1", "quote": "Unless renewed, the 2 and 4-layer exemption from the 25% Section 301 Tariffs are set to expire at the end of May this year.", "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/greg-papandrew-5025834_%F0%9D%97%A7%F0%9D%97%94%F0%9D%97%A5%F0%9D%97%9C%F0%9D%97%99%F0%9D%97%99-%F0%9D%97%A8%F0%9D%97%A3%F0%9D%97%97%F0%9D%97%94%F0%9D%97%A7%F0%9D%97%98-%F0%9D%97%A6%F0%9D%97%A2%F0%9D%97%9F%F0%9D%97%A8%F0%9D%97%A7%F0%9D%97%9C%F0%9D%97%A2%F0%9D%97%A1-activity-7302659128592617473-FCFp", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"expiration_date": "end of May this year", "reported_policy_status": "Unless renewed, the 2 and 4-layer exemption from the 25% Section 301 Tariffs are set to expire at the end of May this year."}}, {"claim_id": "claim_d8d09b08d816b3b378d7df3f", "quote": "Section 301 tariff exclusions for qualifying Chinese-manufactured PCBs have been extended through November 10, 2026, but these exclusions primarily cover 2-layer and 4-layer rigid FR-4 PCBs — flex, rigid-flex, and multilayer constructions above four layers are typically excluded from the exemption benefit.", "url": "https://www.bestfpc.com/news/the-ultimate-guide-to-flex-pcb-pricing-in-2026.html", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 301", "legal_authority": "Section 301", "expiration_date": "November 10, 2026"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_50314181e34eacb95c9fb6a7", "claim_ids": ["claim_588525d31ec109613755a8b6", "claim_ae316680d31d83cc1aff89e3"], "query_ids": ["q_164"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_588525d31ec109613755a8b6", "quote": "As of early 2026, flex and rigid-flex PCBs imported from China face total effective tariffs of approximately 35% — comprising a 25% Section 301 tariff (no exemption currently applies to flex and non-FR4 PCBs) plus a 10% IEEPA global tariff.", "url": "https://www.bestfpc.com/news/the-ultimate-guide-to-flex-pcb-pricing-in-2026.html", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 301 tariff", "duty_rate": "25%"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_ae316680d31d83cc1aff89e3", "quote": "All printed circuit boards manufactured in China, regardless of layer count, are subject to the additional 20% duties effective March 4th, 2025.", "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/greg-papandrew-5025834_%F0%9D%97%A7%F0%9D%97%94%F0%9D%97%A5%F0%9D%97%9C%F0%9D%97%99%F0%9D%97%99-%F0%9D%97%A8%F0%9D%97%A3%F0%9D%97%97%F0%9D%97%94%F0%9D%97%A7%F0%9D%97%98-%F0%9D%97%A6%F0%9D%97%A2%F0%9D%97%9F%F0%9D%97%A8%F0%9D%97%A7%F0%9D%97%9C%F0%9D%97%A2%F0%9D%97%A1-activity-7302659128592617473-FCFp", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"country_of_origin": "China"}}]}, {"pair_id": "conflict_a9de3c499ef41fe841d5d4df", "claim_ids": ["claim_aa0a2b18dc458e27aa90fc4d", "claim_ae316680d31d83cc1aff89e3"], "query_ids": ["q_164"], "claims": [{"claim_id": "claim_aa0a2b18dc458e27aa90fc4d", "quote": "The Section 301 tariff is 25% for all flex and non-FR4 PCBs. An additional IEEPA global tariff of 10% applies to all PCB imports.", "url": "https://www.bestfpc.com/news/the-ultimate-guide-to-flex-pcb-pricing-in-2026.html", "kind": "full_document", "publisher_type": "secondary_or_unverified_publisher", "fields": {"tariff_program": "Section 301", "legal_authority": "IEEPA", "duty_rate": "25%"}}, {"claim_id": "claim_ae316680d31d83cc1aff89e3", "quote": "All printed circuit boards manufactured in China, regardless of layer count, are subject to the additional 20% duties effective March 4th, 2025.", "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/greg-papandrew-5025834_%F0%9D%97%A7%F0%9D%97%94%F0%9D%97%A5%F0%9D%97%9C%F